sequenceDiagram
    title Tick Processing - Strategy Event Execution Error
    autonumber

    participant Bus as EventBus
    participant EventHandler as StrategyEventHandler
    participant ResponseHandler as StrategyResponseHandler

    Bus->>EventHandler: handle(request)
    alt unsupported action such as CANCEL_ORDER
        EventHandler->>ResponseHandler: handle StrategyExecutionResponse(execution_error)
    else broker execution raises
        EventHandler->>ResponseHandler: handle StrategyExecutionResponse(execution_error)
    else no matching close target
        EventHandler->>ResponseHandler: handle StrategyExecutionResponse(execution_error)
    end
    ResponseHandler->>Bus: publish(response)
    Note over Bus,ResponseHandler: Execution errors are normalized into response events
